{"reviewId": "88307275_822k6hYJi", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2005年7月21日，中国宣布汇改：​人民币对美元一次性升值2.1%​​（1美元兑8.11元），并改为参考一篮子货币的有管理浮动汇率制，结束单一盯住美元\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "33192-33289", "abstract": "与颓态尽显的欧元相比，人民币始终是美元的潜在威胁。2005年7月人民币一次汇改，人民币兑美元升值使中国错失了那一次战略机遇，没有抓住中长期美元资产空出的蓄水池机会，美国得以从金融危机中全身而退。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "reviewId": "88307275_822k6hYJi", "userVid": 88307275, "topics": [], "createTime": 1753896090, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 88307275, "name": "‮‮‭BINL😬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jeAgLc5xVvH0tFjJqUmN3oxlu4I8k8sUZHZXaMicun1iatFHDp0WsiadyeP46212d47DXuVTvm1JCibtu8ydUdAMYA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 926822211, "name": "小冯", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0016-~7hbGDcVwP7OhLPZFdBZK10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "俯仰之间，已为陈迹", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [{"content": "2008年金融危机爆发时，美元流动性枯竭，美国急需外部资金承接国债。此时中国持有近2万亿美元外汇储备（60%为美元资产），若大规模减持美债或推动人民币资产国际化，可削弱美元霸权。\n但中国选择维稳汇率​：2008年收窄人民币波幅（6.82-6.84窄幅波动），避免进一步升值冲击出口，同时继续增持美债（2008年增持逾2500亿美元）。此举被部分学者批评为错失降低美元依赖的时机", "reviewId": "88307275_822k6hYJi", "commentId": "88307275_822k6hYJi_c88307275_822kckyc5", "userVid": 88307275, "createTime": 1753896179, "likesCount": 11, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 88307275, "name": "‮‮‭BINL😬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jeAgLc5xVvH0tFjJqUmN3oxlu4I8k8sUZHZXaMicun1iatFHDp0WsiadyeP46212d47DXuVTvm1JCibtu8ydUdAMYA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "comments": [{"content": "2008年金融危机爆发时，美元流动性枯竭，美国急需外部资金承接国债。此时中国持有近2万亿美元外汇储备（60%为美元资产），若大规模减持美债或推动人民币资产国际化，可削弱美元霸权。\n但中国选择维稳汇率​：2008年收窄人民币波幅（6.82-6.84窄幅波动），避免进一步升值冲击出口，同时继续增持美债（2008年增持逾2500亿美元）。此举被部分学者批评为错失降低美元依赖的时机", "reviewId": "88307275_822k6hYJi", "commentId": "88307275_822k6hYJi_c88307275_822kckyc5", "userVid": 88307275, "createTime": 1753896179, "likesCount": 11, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 88307275, "name": "‮‮‭BINL😬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jeAgLc5xVvH0tFjJqUmN3oxlu4I8k8sUZHZXaMicun1iatFHDp0WsiadyeP46212d47DXuVTvm1JCibtu8ydUdAMYA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1791547274}